{
    "comment": "설정의 「일반」 탭 — 「기본값」 탭과 성격이 다르다. 이쪽은 새 게시판이 물려받는 값이 아니라 이미 있는 게시판 전부에 곧바로 걸리는 전역 설정이라 일괄 적용 체크박스가 없다. 날짜 표기 방식(절대/상대)을 카드째 눌러 고른다",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "게시판 환경설정 기본 설정 탭 콘텐츠 (전역 즉시 적용 설정)"
    },
    "id": "tab_content_general",
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "if": "{{(_global.activeBoardSettingsTab || query.tab || 'general') === 'general'}}",
    "children": [
        {
            "id": "general_section",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "board-admin-card"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "H2",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "board-card-title"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.sections.general"
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "board-card-description"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.sections.general_description"
                },
                {
                    "id": "date_display_format_field",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Label",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "board-form-label"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.fields.date_display_format"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "board-text-tertiary"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.fields.date_display_format_hint"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "board-card-stack",
                                "role": "radiogroup",
                                "aria-label": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.fields.date_display_format"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "id": "date_format_option_standard",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "날짜를 「2026-08-04」처럼 그대로 적는 방식. 카드 아무 데나 눌러도 골라지도록 라디오가 아니라 카드에 이벤트를 달았고(라디오 자체는 클릭을 받지 않는다), 폼의 나머지 값을 잃지 않으려 두 층을 각각 펼쳐 담는다",
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "if": "{{!_computed.isReadOnly}}",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "hasChanges": true,
                                                "form.display.date_display_format": "standard"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "{{(_local.form?.display?.date_display_format ?? 'standard') === 'standard' ? 'board:flex board:items-start board:gap-4 board:p-4 board:rounded-lg board:border-2 board:border-blue-500 board:bg-blue-50 board:dark:bg-blue-900/20 board:cursor-pointer' : 'board:flex board:items-start board:gap-4 board:p-4 board:rounded-lg board:border-2 board:border-gray-200 board:dark:border-gray-700 board:bg-white board:dark:bg-gray-800 board:cursor-pointer board:hover:border-gray-300 board:dark:hover:border-gray-600'}}"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Input",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "날짜를 절대 시각으로 보여 준다",
                                                    "type": "change",
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "hasChanges": true,
                                                        "form.display.date_display_format": "standard"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "type": "radio",
                                                "autoBinding": false,
                                                "name": "display.date_display_format",
                                                "value": "standard",
                                                "aria-label": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.options.date_display_format.standard",
                                                "className": "board-radio board:mt-0.5",
                                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}",
                                                "checked": "{{(_local.form?.display?.date_display_format ?? 'standard') === 'standard'}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "board:flex-1 board:min-w-0"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "board-text-primary board:block board:text-sm board:font-semibold"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.options.date_display_format.standard"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "board:block board-text-tertiary board:mt-0.5"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.options.date_display_format.standard_description"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "board:block board:text-xs board:font-mono board:text-blue-600 board:dark:text-blue-400 board:mt-1.5 board:bg-blue-50 board:dark:bg-blue-900/30 board:rounded board:px-2 board:py-1"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.options.date_display_format.standard_example"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "date_format_option_relative",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "날짜를 「3일 전」처럼 지금과의 사이로 적는 방식 — 위 카드와 같은 짜임이고 담기는 값만 다르다",
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "if": "{{!_computed.isReadOnly}}",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "hasChanges": true,
                                                "form.display.date_display_format": "relative"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "{{(_local.form?.display?.date_display_format ?? 'standard') === 'relative' ? 'board:flex board:items-start board:gap-4 board:p-4 board:rounded-lg board:border-2 board:border-blue-500 board:bg-blue-50 board:dark:bg-blue-900/20 board:cursor-pointer' : 'board:flex board:items-start board:gap-4 board:p-4 board:rounded-lg board:border-2 board:border-gray-200 board:dark:border-gray-700 board:bg-white board:dark:bg-gray-800 board:cursor-pointer board:hover:border-gray-300 board:dark:hover:border-gray-600'}}"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Input",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "날짜를 「3일 전」 같은 상대 표기로 보여 준다",
                                                    "type": "change",
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "hasChanges": true,
                                                        "form.display.date_display_format": "relative"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "type": "radio",
                                                "autoBinding": false,
                                                "name": "display.date_display_format",
                                                "value": "relative",
                                                "aria-label": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.options.date_display_format.relative",
                                                "className": "board-radio board:mt-0.5",
                                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}",
                                                "checked": "{{(_local.form?.display?.date_display_format ?? 'standard') === 'relative'}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "board:flex-1 board:min-w-0"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "board-text-primary board:block board:text-sm board:font-semibold"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.options.date_display_format.relative"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "board:block board-text-tertiary board:mt-0.5"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.options.date_display_format.relative_description"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "board:block board:text-xs board:font-mono board:text-blue-600 board:dark:text-blue-400 board:mt-1.5 board:bg-blue-50 board:dark:bg-blue-900/30 board:rounded board:px-2 board:py-1"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.options.date_display_format.relative_example"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "attachment_cleanup_section",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "board-admin-card board:mt-6"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "H2",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "board-card-title"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.sections.attachment_cleanup"
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "board-card-description"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.sections.attachment_cleanup_description"
                },
                {
                    "id": "attachment_purge_enabled_field",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "board-flex-between board:gap-4 board:mt-4"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "board:min-w-0"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Label",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "board-form-label"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.fields.attachment_purge_enabled"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "board-text-tertiary"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.fields.attachment_purge_enabled_hint"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "composite",
                            "name": "Toggle",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "오래된 첨부 자동 정리 사용 여부. 켜야 아래 보관 일수가 쓰인다",
                                    "type": "change",
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "local",
                                        "hasChanges": true,
                                        "form.attachment_settings.purge_enabled": "{{$event.target.checked}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "name": "attachment_settings.purge_enabled",
                                "className": "board:flex-shrink-0",
                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}",
                                "checked": "{{!!_local.form?.attachment_settings?.purge_enabled}}"
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "attachment_purge_retention_days_field",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "board:mt-4"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Label",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "board-form-label"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.fields.attachment_purge_retention_days"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "board-text-tertiary"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.settings.fields.attachment_purge_retention_days_hint"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Input",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "첨부 보관 일수. 이 기간이 지난 첨부가 정리 대상이 된다",
                                    "type": "change",
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "local",
                                        "hasChanges": true,
                                        "form.attachment_settings.purge_retention_days": "{{$event.target.value}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "number",
                                "name": "attachment_settings.purge_retention_days",
                                "min": "{{_local?.form?._meta?.limits?.attachment_purge_retention_days_min ?? 1}}",
                                "max": "{{_local?.form?._meta?.limits?.attachment_purge_retention_days_max ?? 3650}}",
                                "className": "board-input board:w-40",
                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}",
                                "value": "{{_local.form?.attachment_settings?.purge_retention_days ?? 30}}"
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
